      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS AUSTRALIANA (1) has raced two times this prep and has filled a minor placing on each occasion. Was about the mark yet again last start when she led and battled on well but found one better at Penrith over 1720m. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Won't find this any harder and she can find winning ways. LOUIGI (4) was in the money two runs back before another sound effort at his latest appearance over 1609m at this track, beaten 3.5 metres into third after being handy all the way. Won't find this any harder and he can give this a mighty shake. MISTER BRILLANTE (3) disappointed last time when eighth over 1609m at this track. Can turn things around. TEN GALLON (2) is in the mix following a fourth at his most recent appearance over 1609m at this track.",
